    "detailed_description": "In the era of the end of the law, the aura is getting thinner and thinner, the chaos in the world is frequent, the Tao has disappeared and the devil has grown up, and the fate of the world has come to an end. A group of living beings are pursuing the legend of the ancient immortals, hoping to ascend to transcendence and obtain eternal life.<br />\r\n1\u3001Open world, randomly generated map<br />\r\n2\u3001Multiplayer cooperation (10-20 people), you can explore alone, but also with your buddies to adventure, fight, explore the secret world;<br />\r\n3\u3001Ground combat/fighting, etc. You can also build your own territory on land;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSpecific play:<br />\r\n1\u3001Cave, clan<br />\r\n2\u3001Building, farming<br />\r\n3\u3001Smithing, alchemy<br />\r\n4\u3001Magic treasures, techniques, formations<br />\r\n5\u3001random map generation, demonic beast fighting, etc.",
